{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c063e3322ff53f9130101f3f5d6960c57634ed6daf72ed8e2cd22d94ce6d2277", "ja": "インストアライブ＆特典サイン＆握手会当日\n開始前……", "zh": "店内演唱会、特典签名会及握手会当天\n开始前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "13182ce9c37051ac29756a5a499d86b76b6cb0de750d3a2443c49263b451bbb5", "ja": "プロデューサーさん、お疲れさまです～。\n朝はなかなか大変だったようですね～？", "zh": "制作人，辛苦了～。\n早上好像挺不容易的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "b8bf50a528530449ef3c1b159ee5de3dd3cd28fc1a2845d066cf9b8fc53fed52", "ja": "ああ、予想以上の列で、ほんと大変だったよ……。\n朋花のファ、……子豚ちゃんたちは熱心だな。", "zh": "啊，队伍比预想的还长，真是够呛的……\n朋花的粉丝……小猪猪们还真是热情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "0cc8e57fbccd14b6bf9b75c90d3f0e905510545ca6c7968afde3d0f4e8af2a04", "ja": "仕方ありません～。今日は聖母が地上に降臨し、\n触れ合うことを許された約束の日……。", "zh": "没办法啦～今天可是圣母降临人间、获准与大家接触的约定之日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "3623d17cb8893866ecef98c6a25d2aab55bc95409c2461d97404b59cd046517d", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたちはもちろん、天空騎士団のみなさんも\n待ち焦がれていたようですからね～。", "zh": "小猪崽们自不必说，天空骑士团的各位\n似乎也已经翘首以盼了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "c358c40a5df4aa24523d15064e6871edef315541666e66e030f498916bfe61ce", "ja": "天空騎士団……なんというか、規律正しい人たちだな。\nええと、親衛隊みたいなものだっけ？", "zh": "天空骑士团……怎么说呢，真是一群守纪律的人啊。\n呃，是类似于亲卫队的存在吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "a7f906363e7613b103bee1629f8badfc8bea57367797477056cc8f99607b4def", "ja": "はい♪　いつも自主的に、私の周りで混乱が起きない\nよう気を配ってくれているんですよ～。", "zh": "是的♪他们总是自发地帮忙留意，不让我的身边发生混乱呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "faf9d359bcab93144bf97749c634631cbd232f7fb63cbdd58e3b547fe154ea20", "ja": "今朝も子豚ちゃんたちを整列させてくれたよ。\n正直、助かった……。俺も見習わないとな。", "zh": "今天早上也帮忙让小猪猪们排好队了。\n说实话，真是帮大忙了……我也得学学才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "f7fd695c6e4f22fb37ff8ab45a2a26f0c30b1ecee6854e3b48ca61ef295d7850", "ja": "……。\nそういった心構えでは困りますね～。", "zh": "……\n抱着这种心态可让人困扰呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "8c3442d63c87c604e87f316cd3fb7fd77f61289478d8b4b1a4ae60c696a65184", "ja": "言ったはずですよ～？　あなたは聖母の従者であり、\n私たちTeam1stの導き手。", "zh": "我说过的哦～？您是圣母的侍从，\n也是我们Team1st的引路人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "c961f6a217830defbc796f0ed014e87384f71adf6693e85b0b83fc045dd643d4", "ja": "一歩遅れてついて来るのではなく、常に隣を歩き、\n行く手を示す覚悟をしておいてくださいね～？", "zh": "不要落后一步跟着我们，而是要做好始终走在身边、为我们指引前路的觉悟哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "7f08703fbe602416c11f4a678e07d58ef9e807c263de58f5bb4234bcd1452d56", "ja": "常に隣を……そうだよな。\nわかった。しっかり、隣を歩くようにするよ。", "zh": "时刻走在身边……是啊。\n我知道了。我会好好努力，一直走在你身边的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "4df0c744d0d423a2e83d2ae2b07946ef78efb124d31fe26d28cfd3d70c3e4eb6", "ja": "だから、何かあったらいつでも言ってくれ。\n朋花も、一人じゃないからな！", "zh": "所以，有什么事就随时告诉我。\n朋花也不是一个人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "845a71a56c0470b9e125b3d4f42101ce9f9ebf0d783a9f480b7c3efb26fa8d85", "ja": "あれ？　なんか、マズいこと……言ったかな？", "zh": "咦？我是不是……说了什么不妥的话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0423_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "5b90ab659153d9b0b7a5f739f2c9c2ef3e9c2c02cccd893b3dc0d63c6b410b04", "ja": "いいえ、何も。ただ……。\n今の言葉、しっかり覚えておきますね～？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "没有，什么都没有哦。只是……\n刚才那句话，我会好好记住的呢～？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
